    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 328,
        "text": "Welcome to the Riverside Learning Centre. Before we begin, look at the plan. North is at the top, and you are entering through the door in the middle of the south wall. The main passage runs straight north. Three short passages cross it, making three junctions. Count them from the entrance, not from the top of the page.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "889bfa5ba20c048bb88d7cc7f7fff9352c5a73373b039230c5b429d0778cd348",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 330,
        "sourceEnd": 585,
        "text": "At the first junction, turn left. The room at the end of that short passage contains the welcome desk. Please leave large bags there before joining a practical session. You may keep a small notebook with you, but bags must not be left in the main passage.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "464987bad34e0480afed43c8b3ae6d58dee8ba263b00bc582ef2a4b61e6cf594",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 587,
        "sourceEnd": 838,
        "text": "The equipment store is opposite the welcome desk, across the main passage. Some older leaflets put it on the western side. That information is out of date: the store is now east of the first junction. Collect gloves there after you have left your bag.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "2d792422d7a830d1f961b59ad3609512c36f3ce500478dfc8cc07a416898bdd0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 840,
        "sourceEnd": 1197,
        "text": "For the repair workshop, return to the main passage and face north again. Go past the first junction to the second one, then turn right. That room is where the practical session takes place. If you come out of the workshop and walk straight across the main passage, you reach the quiet study room. Please close its door gently; people may be working inside.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "eafd7dfd6e29bedeff2d26d6eb2aab0f6645c685a5bc1c8a35d3e9daadc9e650",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 1199,
        "sourceEnd": 1515,
        "text": "The seed library is farther north. From the entrance, walk past the first two junctions. At the third and last junction, turn left. Across the main passage from the seed library is the community meeting room. The meeting room is not next to the entrance, although that was its location before the centre was rebuilt.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "bc21a9267345dc2b7696cc6607d338cddf087b2e880b2db85e5e158fc2944d53",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      },
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 1517,
        "sourceEnd": 1854,
        "text": "Finally, if you are leaving the repair workshop, walk west to the main passage, turn left, and continue south to the entrance. Turning right would take you towards the seed library instead. Keep the passage clear at all times. We will meet at the welcome desk in ten minutes, so you have time to find each room before the session starts.",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "d0dd615d2db942fc664d3c2a0b58679d1193bcc37926e1bc3c9c914a475edea8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.8
      }
    ]
  },
